{
 "rate_s_per_char": 0.22374194084507046,
 "lead": 0.244292,
 "tail": 190.806,
 "cost": -3.8267880220915513,
 "segments": [
  {
   "seg": "02",
   "shot": "P01",
   "text": "大家好，歡迎嚟到阿斯康。",
   "start": 0.244,
   "end": 2.167,
   "dur": 1.923,
   "chars": 10,
   "cps": 5.2,
   "gap_after": 0.353,
   "tag": "open_cam",
   "cut": [
    0.184,
    2.287
   ],
   "sha256": "0559f8822bb8fef870bb498c0abf4b4ac17ff7d406e2a6657151810c959f4d16"
  },
  {
   "seg": "03",
   "shot": "02",
   "text": "今日同大家分享，點解講抗衰老，除咗食啲乜，幾時食都咁值得留意。",
   "start": 2.52,
   "end": 9.225,
   "dur": 6.705,
   "chars": 27,
   "cps": 4.03,
   "gap_after": 0.52,
   "tag": "open_vo",
   "cut": [
    2.46,
    9.345
   ],
   "sha256": "a5317b1bcdc040f5d314cc852b43b6df2116adcfe5efca2c9c9243d3f8d77ab6"
  },
  {
   "seg": "04",
   "shot": "03",
   "text": "試諗吓，你開始留意營養，揀咗補充品，每日都記得食。",
   "start": 9.745,
   "end": 15.453,
   "dur": 5.708,
   "chars": 21,
   "cps": 3.68,
   "gap_after": 0.194,
   "tag": "n03",
   "cut": [
    9.685,
    15.573
   ],
   "sha256": "2d06972e2d2be69950ef5cdd6b09b78169e07072b5fdc0a864d76150df03ddf1"
  },
  {
   "seg": "05",
   "shot": "04",
   "text": "但忙起上嚟，食飯時間成日變，午餐又推遲咗。",
   "start": 15.647,
   "end": 20.23,
   "dur": 4.583,
   "chars": 18,
   "cps": 3.93,
   "gap_after": 0.444,
   "tag": "n04",
   "cut": [
    15.587,
    20.35
   ],
   "sha256": "3725d75ecf23fa0ed0eb2ef72ecbf31708a66f59a22d65846fc60b83019348de"
  },
  {
   "seg": "06",
   "shot": "05",
   "text": "夜晚再睇多一陣手機，不知不覺，又夜咗瞓。",
   "start": 20.674,
   "end": 24.817,
   "dur": 4.143,
   "chars": 17,
   "cps": 4.1,
   "gap_after": 0.345,
   "tag": "n05",
   "cut": [
    20.614,
    24.937
   ],
   "sha256": "97648b06c8feff5127d0063686afd6ee25fe7cb1619497ed19a889f8e912428e"
  },
  {
   "seg": "07",
   "shot": "P02",
   "text": "咁樣，補充咗就夠未？",
   "start": 25.162,
   "end": 27.326,
   "dur": 2.164,
   "chars": 8,
   "cps": 3.7,
   "gap_after": 0.621,
   "tag": "p02_cam",
   "cut": [
    25.102,
    27.446
   ],
   "sha256": "7c54206a56fe3a2a00253856bf1cccd28e1a2c51565893edfccc032bf76baf39"
  },
  {
   "seg": "08",
   "shot": "06",
   "text": "要答呢個問題，我哋先睇吓細胞呢座日夜運作嘅城市。",
   "start": 27.947,
   "end": 32.887,
   "dur": 4.94,
   "chars": 22,
   "cps": 4.45,
   "gap_after": 0.507,
   "tag": "n06",
   "cut": [
    27.887,
    33.007
   ],
   "sha256": "6f22ccbb859b51102131db14057dc07a80c3686558db4bc7bc9c0058834cb9ae"
  },
  {
   "seg": "09",
   "shot": "07",
   "text": "線粒體，好似發電站，幫細胞提供運作需要嘅能量。",
   "start": 33.394,
   "end": 38.506,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "chars": 20,
   "cps": 3.91,
   "gap_after": 0.307,
   "tag": "n07",
   "cut": [
    33.334,
    38.626
   ],
   "sha256": "303b282608b91ba33df471322ad0d1242d3131089a0ac0415715a616b1a8eba1"
  },
  {
   "seg": "10",
   "shot": "08",
   "text": "你每日行路、活動，背後都有細胞嘅能量供應。",
   "start": 38.813,
   "end": 43.365,
   "dur": 4.552,
   "chars": 18,
   "cps": 3.95,
   "gap_after": 0.505,
   "tag": "n08",
   "cut": [
    38.753,
    43.485
   ],
   "sha256": "977578de20be3b7156bd8f9d802d6f545dc6334d7f0621f5fa7ea6ebcd5f625f"
  },
  {
   "seg": "11",
   "shot": "09",
   "text": "呢座城市亦有回收站。溶酶體，會分解同回收部分受損嘅蛋白質同部件。",
   "start": 43.87,
   "end": 50.959,
   "dur": 7.089,
   "chars": 29,
   "cps": 4.09,
   "gap_after": 0.521,
   "tag": "n09",
   "cut": [
    43.81,
    51.079
   ],
   "sha256": "5380d11196484f04dbb8dc1b4da2b7232e0571c6cfaf9947df5332afe4de10a4"
  },
  {
   "seg": "12",
   "shot": "10",
   "text": "仲有維修工作。例如遺傳物質嘅修復，就係幫細胞維護遺傳物質嘅完整性。",
   "start": 51.48,
   "end": 59.117,
   "dur": 7.637,
   "chars": 28,
   "cps": 3.67,
   "gap_after": 0.553,
   "tag": "n10",
   "cut": [
    51.42,
    59.237
   ],
   "sha256": "663ca68c10e1c08dc19ac50fa9b7fed4d7b87224715607179e0a3aa2c194c005",
   "text_note": "spoken wording (approved alternative to DNA修復)"
  },
  {
   "seg": "13",
   "shot": "11",
   "text": "隨住年齡增長，部分能量、清理同維護功能可能減弱。損傷日積月累，就可能影響細胞，以至組織同器官嘅表現。",
   "start": 59.67,
   "end": 71.245,
   "dur": 11.575,
   "chars": 44,
   "cps": 3.8,
   "gap_after": 0.627,
   "tag": "n11",
   "cut": [
    59.61,
    71.365
   ],
   "sha256": "e3b5e24e4b9c43ce9eb2bf1812e9540075953f48eece642504d22a4ea26ac945"
  },
  {
   "seg": "14",
   "shot": "P03",
   "text": "但細胞嘅工作，原來仲有時間表。",
   "start": 71.872,
   "end": 74.805,
   "dur": 2.933,
   "chars": 13,
   "cps": 4.43,
   "gap_after": 0.48,
   "tag": "p03_cam",
   "cut": [
    71.812,
    74.925
   ],
   "sha256": "fbb48ab5f6180600e6a5356839b9a5fd586e3bb026dec122cd4022e81e111cf5"
  },
  {
   "seg": "15",
   "shot": "12",
   "text": "而朝早嘅光線，就係重要嘅時間訊號。",
   "start": 75.285,
   "end": 78.482,
   "dur": 3.197,
   "chars": 15,
   "cps": 4.69,
   "gap_after": 0.427,
   "tag": "n12",
   "cut": [
    75.225,
    78.602
   ],
   "sha256": "51c1254f328c0e30bc4520cb344186bbaf5775f29560511b9ef00c3f93ee68fa"
  },
  {
   "seg": "16",
   "shot": "13",
   "text": "光線會影響腦內嘅主時鐘，再協調唔同器官同細胞嘅時鐘。代謝同部分維護工作，都受到日夜節律調節。節律同細胞功能，亦會隨住衰老互相影響。",
   "start": 78.909,
   "end": 93.699,
   "dur": 14.79,
   "chars": 59,
   "cps": 3.99,
   "gap_after": 0.527,
   "tag": "n13",
   "cut": [
    78.849,
    93.819
   ],
   "sha256": "7ac66e4e75ab6fe973b48468552b99cb0bd4fd21d3835740f13c50bb2e241775"
  },
  {
   "seg": "17",
   "shot": "14",
   "text": "所以，睡眠同節律值得一齊照顧。但修復唔係只喺夜晚發生，唔同工作，有各自嘅節奏。",
   "start": 94.226,
   "end": 102.886,
   "dur": 8.66,
   "chars": 34,
   "cps": 3.93,
   "gap_after": 0.456,
   "tag": "n14",
   "cut": [
    94.166,
    103.006
   ],
   "sha256": "1f6b94abd2afa9ac463c468b606ddfb782b93fe7fe2f193d31473221650d8a34"
  },
  {
   "seg": "18",
   "shot": "15",
   "text": "進餐時間，亦會影響部分外周時鐘同代謝節律。食乜，同幾時食，係兩個值得一齊理解嘅問題。",
   "start": 103.342,
   "end": 112.117,
   "dur": 8.775,
   "chars": 37,
   "cps": 4.22,
   "gap_after": 0.606,
   "tag": "n15",
   "cut": [
    103.282,
    112.237
   ],
   "sha256": "8a07779bcbe0f20ea2d12f46b00c9b1b431f80ad8ec6d6ac9620c31fa9e7a7df"
  },
  {
   "seg": "19",
   "shot": "16",
   "text": "研究一種成分，好似研究點樣改善一個發電站。但要照顧成座城市，就要再睇埋整體。",
   "start": 112.723,
   "end": 120.871,
   "dur": 8.148,
   "chars": 34,
   "cps": 4.17,
   "gap_after": 0.478,
   "tag": "n16",
   "cut": [
    112.663,
    120.991
   ],
   "sha256": "de110f3e06f80f24190afb5f8545f61fa7a0d93fffcaff9ff6015fd72432e121"
  },
  {
   "seg": "20",
   "shot": "17",
   "text": "營養同代謝提供原料同能量，荷爾蒙傳遞調節訊息，免疫亦參與細胞環境嘅調節。細胞功能，同全身系統一直互相影響。",
   "start": 121.349,
   "end": 134.56,
   "dur": 13.211,
   "chars": 48,
   "cps": 3.63,
   "gap_after": 0.46,
   "tag": "n17",
   "cut": [
    121.289,
    134.68
   ],
   "sha256": "dc191d1163f56a4446a4b4bcd4da05387eb1072f77d3f8158375007095442ef4"
  },
  {
   "seg": "21",
   "shot": "P04",
   "text": "呢個就係阿斯康嘅理念：系統性、節律性、實際應用。",
   "start": 135.02,
   "end": 140.04,
   "dur": 5.02,
   "chars": 20,
   "cps": 3.98,
   "gap_after": 0.39,
   "tag": "p04_cam",
   "cut": [
    134.96,
    140.16
   ],
   "sha256": "5eac1039f84cd62336f2d4ddb1705627c16286d33ac51011737e48667f5aa98b"
  },
  {
   "seg": "22",
   "shot": "18",
   "text": "先建立飲食、活動同睡眠嘅基礎，再按需要同證據，考慮營養支持。用乜、點用、幾時用，要逐項睇，唔係每樽都硬分早午晚。",
   "start": 140.43,
   "end": 153.782,
   "dur": 13.352,
   "chars": 47,
   "cps": 3.52,
   "gap_after": 0.628,
   "tag": "n18",
   "cut": [
    140.37,
    153.902
   ],
   "sha256": "08136fd837420eb6843f2338b6aa6e11374e3cf668b4523357ce9d08258f62bb"
  },
  {
   "seg": "23",
   "shot": "19",
   "text": "跟住阿斯康，我哋會帶你由細胞嘅能量、清理同修復出發，一齊探索身體機能同生命節律，點樣變成每日做得到嘅選擇。呢段抗衰老旅程，由認識自己開始。",
   "start": 154.41,
   "end": 169.779,
   "dur": 15.369,
   "chars": 62,
   "cps": 4.03,
   "gap_after": 0.838,
   "tag": "n19",
   "cut": [
    154.35,
    169.899
   ],
   "sha256": "a50d8214488da719efd5c8426920533b1e38e134f647755a54d0edb80d1cc56d"
  },
  {
   "seg": "24",
   "shot": "P05",
   "text": "今日先同大家分享到呢度。之後我哋會繼續推出更多短片，由細胞、身體機能到日常生活，一步步同大家了解，乜嘢先係真正嘅抗衰老。下次再同大家分享。拜拜！",
   "start": 170.617,
   "end": 185.373,
   "dur": 14.756,
   "chars": 64,
   "cps": 4.34,
   "gap_after": 1.131,
   "tag": "end_cam",
   "cut": [
    170.557,
    185.493
   ],
   "sha256": "84c45244f5b46d16672764c869dbcc0932769f03216a3653f6bcbcc2eda65dfe"
  },
  {
   "seg": "25",
   "shot": "20",
   "text": "阿斯康。從細胞出發，配合生命嘅節律。",
   "start": 186.504,
   "end": 190.806,
   "dur": 4.302,
   "chars": 15,
   "cps": 3.49,
   "gap_after": null,
   "tag": "n20",
   "cut": [
    186.444,
    190.926
   ],
   "sha256": "0936aa1d17190fcf899a325c12588854925974e20e5cf47ebfd044c44a35240e"
  }
 ],
